The Audi A3 Cabriolet was discontinued after the 2020 model year. The TDI engine was not available for the 2020 Cabriolet in most markets. The most recent Audi A3 Cabriolet with a TDI engine was likely from the 2017-2018 model years. This evaluation is based on the specs of a 2017 Audi A3 Cabriolet 2.0 TDI (150PS), which is representative of the most recent TDI variant of this model.

Here is the evaluation of the 2017 Audi A3 Cabriolet 2.0 TDI:

*   **price_usd**: Based on UK pricing around £30,000 in 2017 (Source 10), which is roughly equivalent to $38,000 USD. This is close to the market average of $35,000. Score 0.00.
